    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>SmartSell Ranker Plugin will automatically assign the top selling products from a set time period to a set category. This assignment will be done through a scheduled Cron job that will perform product updates on a 24-hour basis with additional features to manage and optimize product categorization, enabling dynamic changes based on sales volume.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>MODERN WAY:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Go to the WordPress Dashboard “Add New Plugin” section.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Search For “SmartSell Ranker”.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Install, then Activate it.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p>OLD WAY:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Upload the plugin folder to the /wp-content/plugins/ directory.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Activate the plugin through the ‘Plugins’ menu in WordPress.</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='does%20this%20work%20without%20the%20woocommerce%20plugin%3F'>\nDoes this work without the Woocommerce plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>No, it require Woocommerce plugin to use.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<p>Version 1.0</p>\n<p>Initial Release</p>\n"
    },
